This license covers the source code of the nichefiletools project
(the Next.js web app under web/, the Tauri 2 desktop app under desktop/,
and all build scripts). It does NOT cover the third-party libraries and
external engines listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md, which remain governed by
their own licenses — in particular FFmpeg (LGPL-2.1+), which is distributed
as a prebuilt WebAssembly binary in web/public/ffmpeg/, and the GPL-licensed
external engines (Blender, Calibre) which are invoked as separate processes
and are NOT distributed with this project.
